# Gemini API key for Member 3's AI recommendations.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste a real key to enable Gemini-backed
# reports. `ai_service.py` calls load_dotenv(), so the value is picked up from
# `.env` automatically.
#
# Without a key the app still works: POST /api/recommendations falls back to
# the deterministic rule-based report and reports `"source": "fallback"`.
#
# Get a key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
